=3D&quot;true&quot; class=3D&quot;&quot;&gt;=0A                                                   =
 1. If your printer connects by a wire=0A                                  =
              &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                              =
  &lt;p&gt;If your printer connects by a wire,=0A                                =
                    plug it into your device. It&#039;ll connect automatically, =
your=0A                                                    PC will download=
 the right drivers, and you can use it right=0A                            =
                        away.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A                              =
                  &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                              =
      2. To connect a wireless printer, download the latest=0A             =
