playing=0A                                                    any errors.&lt;/=
p&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A        =
                                            2. Connect your printer: Follow=
 the instructions that=0A                                                  =
  came with the printer to connect it to the network.=0A                   =
                             &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                               =
                 &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    =
If you have a Wi-Fi printer, you might need to connect=0A                  =
                                  the printer to your Mac with a USB cable =
to set up Wi-Fi=0A                                                    print=
ing. After connecting the printer to your Mac,=0A                          =
                          install the Mac software that came with the print=
er and=0A                                                    use the printe=
r=E2=80=99s setup assistant to connect the printer=0A                      =
                              to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you =
can=0A                                                    disconnect the ca=
ble from your printer and Mac and the=0A                                   =
                 printer should remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A  =
                                              &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                   =
                             &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                   =
                 3. Add the printer to your list of available printers:=0A =
                                               &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A             =
                                   &lt;p&gt;=0A                                  =
                  Choose Apple menu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=
=0A                                                    &amp; Scanners in the si=
debar. (You may need to scroll=0A                                          =
          down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;=
strong&gt;=0A                                                    4. When your =
printer appears in the list, select your=0A                                =
                    printer, then click Add.=0A                            =
                    &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                     =
           &lt;p&gt; It may take a minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A  =
                                                  If you see a message prom=
pting you to download new=0A                                               =
     software, make sure to download and install it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A          =
                                      &lt;strong&gt;=0A                          =
                          5. If you do not see your printer listed on the l=
eft,=0A                                                    click the Add Pr=
inter, Scanner or Fax button on the=0A                                     =
